**Total for the year: €2,120**, so each of you (Sam, Priya and Tom) pays about **€706.67**.

Your list had February twice (198 both times). I treated that as a typo and counted it once, so there are 12 months. If the second Feb entry was real, the total would be €2,318 and each share €772.67.

Three shares of €706.67 add up to €2,120.01, so one person can pay €706.66 to make it exact.
